// Excel's Insert Function catalogue — category, description, and each
// argument's name and description — for the functions this engine implements
// (fit-gap XL-UX-026/027). Data, not code: one row per function, keyed by the
// name `function_catalog()` reports, and a browser spec fails if any
// implemented function is missing here. Excel's wording, en-US.
//
// Row: [category, description, [[argument, description], ...], repeat]. An
// argument in [brackets] is optional; `repeat` is how many trailing arguments
// form a group that repeats with its trailing number incremented (Number2 ->
// Number3 ...), as Excel's Function Arguments grows a box when one is filled.

